{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>For</b> — These are the words of HaShem to the angels, and this is the commandment that He commanded them concerning you, for He said to them, <i>ki zeh avdi</i> ('for this is My servant')." "<b>Because he has desired Me, I will deliver him; I will set him on high</b> — that the enemy will not be able to do him harm, because he knows the sod of My name."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 91, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:57.107479465Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}